<title>CHINA: China Jan-March zinc exports up 178.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-March zinc exports up 178.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's exports of unwrought zinc and zinc alloys reached 128,527 tonnes in the first three months, up 178.8 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Friday.</p>
<p>	 EXPORTS JAN-MARCH     MARCH   YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Zinc   128,527		  55,218     +178.8</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
